Third-party notices

This project is a DeepSeek Harness plugin. It does not vendor the projects it
drives; it installs, starts, and talks to them at runtime.

1. ai-goofish-monitor — https://github.com/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor
   MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 dingyufei615.
   The FastAPI backend, Playwright scraper, and Vue console hosted by this
   plugin are that project's work; this repository only launches and controls
   them over HTTP.

2. dsh-our-free-model — https://github.com/Ebony-Vinyl/dsh-our-free-model
   The plugin whose local OpenAI-compatible gateway supplies free model lanes
   for listing analysis. This repository reads its settings, never modifies
   them.

3. DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — the host application this plugin is written for.
